    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115875" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψῡχᾰγώγ-ιον</span></b> , τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχομαντεῖον</span>
			, <i>a place where departed souls are conjured up,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				EM
				819.25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>air-hole, ventilator in the shafts of mines,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Ign.</u>
				24
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εῖον</span>
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>reservoir, reserve water-tank,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AB
				317
			</span></i>.</div>
